            "type": "game",
            "name": "Back in 1995",
            "steam_appid": 433380,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433380/extras/6bbb18fb93d1b87ac8e660fc3b56532a.avif?t=1783934173\" width=600 height=242 /></span><br><br>Step back in time with &quot;Back in 1995,&quot; a homage to the survival horror and mystery games that defined the original PlayStation era. This game meticulously recreates the nuances of a period in gaming history that's close to being forgotten.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a surreal yet tangible world, where you are compelled to solve the enigma of your daughter's disappearance, the calamity that befell the city, and the reason for your long-overdue return.<br><br>Conceived as a passion project by indie developer Takaaki Ichijo, &quot;Back in 1995&quot; aims to capture the distinct emotional resonance he experienced with his early gaming adventures on the PlayStation and Sega Saturn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433380/extras/5db3e1791db350fbca2806e0828a8574.avif?t=1783934173\" width=600 height=182 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lose yourself in the world of retro 3D visuals, complete with low-res models, texture warping, CRT emulation, and fixed CCTV-style camera angles.<br></li><li>Experience the mystery genre anew, navigated through an old school retro user interface and tank controls.<br></li><li>Investigate a barren urban landscape set in the year 1995, abundant with hints about its bygone days.<br></li><li>Engage with a roster of complex characters, each with mysterious intentions that you may never fully understand.<br></li><li>Unravel the hidden secrets about you, your daughter, and the city's past.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433380/extras/8552e1bfb893c8f6d2ca1ae460c01f11.avif?t=1783934173\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br><br>* D-pad recommended<br>* A 720p or greater screen resolution is required<br>* Approximate playtime is 2-3 hours",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433380/extras/6bbb18fb93d1b87ac8e660fc3b56532a.avif?t=1783934173\" width=600 height=242 /></span><br><br>Step back in time with &quot;Back in 1995,&quot; a homage to the survival horror and mystery games that defined the original PlayStation era. This game meticulously recreates the nuances of a period in gaming history that's close to being forgotten.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a surreal yet tangible world, where you are compelled to solve the enigma of your daughter's disappearance, the calamity that befell the city, and the reason for your long-overdue return.<br><br>Conceived as a passion project by indie developer Takaaki Ichijo, &quot;Back in 1995&quot; aims to capture the distinct emotional resonance he experienced with his early gaming adventures on the PlayStation and Sega Saturn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433380/extras/5db3e1791db350fbca2806e0828a8574.avif?t=1783934173\" width=600 height=182 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lose yourself in the world of retro 3D visuals, complete with low-res models, texture warping, CRT emulation, and fixed CCTV-style camera angles.<br></li><li>Experience the mystery genre anew, navigated through an old school retro user interface and tank controls.<br></li><li>Investigate a barren urban landscape set in the year 1995, abundant with hints about its bygone days.<br></li><li>Engage with a roster of complex characters, each with mysterious intentions that you may never fully understand.<br></li><li>Unravel the hidden secrets about you, your daughter, and the city's past.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/433380/extras/8552e1bfb893c8f6d2ca1ae460c01f11.avif?t=1783934173\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br><br>* D-pad recommended<br>* A 720p or greater screen resolution is required<br>* Approximate playtime is 2-3 hours",
